    "title_en": "Correspondence Between Mean Curvature Flow and Harmonic-Ricci Flow",
    "abstract_en": "In this paper, we observe that the (spacelike) mean curvature flow of a submanifold in a (pseudo-)Euclidean space is equivalent to a harmonic-Ricci flow with coupling constant $\\alpha =-1$ (or $+1$), for the corresponding Gauss map and the induced metric. The solitons of these two flows are also equivalent. As an application, we get a monotonicity formula for the spacelike mean curvature flow.",
